       The relationship between eeppoollll__wwaaiitt() and eeppoollll__ppwwaaiitt() is analogous to
       the relationship between sseelleecctt(2)  and  ppsseelleecctt(2):  like  ppsseelleecctt(2),
       eeppoollll__ppwwaaiitt()  allows an application to safely wait until either a file
       descriptor becomes ready or until a signal is caught.

       The following eeppoollll__ppwwaaiitt() call:

